    "detailed_description": "<strong>About the Game</strong><br><br>Welcome to the whimsical world of Donuts! Dive into a delightful merge adventure where your mission is simple yet endlessly entertaining: merge on Donuts!<br><br>Every 3 hours and 18 hours, a surprise Donut will appear, ready to join your vibrant collection. Can you gather them all?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><strong>A Bounty of Donuts</strong>: Discover a diverse array of quirky Donuts, each with its own unique charm.<br><strong>Collectible Items</strong>: Find special items to enhance and grow your Donut collection.<br><strong>Merge System</strong>: Combine Donuts to unlock new and exciting variations, increasing their value and rarity.<br><strong>Achievement</strong>: Unlock a unique achievement as you expand your Donut empire.<br><strong>Endless Fun</strong>: With so much to explore and collect, the fun never stops in the world of Donuts!<br><br>Get ready to collect, merge, and build your way to Donut greatness!",
